      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The ball-milled powder has a high dislocation density.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The ball-milled powder may contain oxygen contamination.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7866258::rubric_effects::000::f41c1717b0"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The optimal SPS temperature window for Mg-Al-Ti-V-Fe-Co is 850–950 °C.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Diffusion at 850–950 °C decomposes the metastable BCC solution into refractory-rich intermetallic phases.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7866258::rubric_effects::000::f41c1717b0"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The resulting precipitates form a continuous nanoscale Ti-V-Fe-rich Laves- or B2-type network at grain boundaries.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intermetallic precipitates pin grain boundaries and prevent grain coarsening.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7866258::rubric_effects::001::1589586d86"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The grain-boundary precipitate network creates a tortuous diffusion path for both Mg and oxygen.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The precipitate network suppresses Mg volatility during sintering.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grain-boundary pinning by the precipitates promotes bulk densification.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The sintered Mg-Al-Ti-V-Fe-Co microstructure promotes formation of a dense Cr/Fe-enriched passive oxide film.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::rubric_effects::002::065b5a3f8d",
        "PMC7475834::rubric_effects::006::d7793bce30"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "A dense passive oxide film limits oxygen ingress and improves oxidation resistance.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::rubric_effects::002::065b5a3f8d"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "A prominent intermetallic network and grain refinement can coincide with high hardness and improved oxidation resistance.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::rubric_effects::002::065b5a3f8d"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Above 1000 °C, Mg evaporation causes composition deviation and porosity in Mg-Al-Ti-V-Fe-Co.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Higher sintering temperature increases diffusion, promotes grain coarsening, and causes reverse dissolution of Laves phases.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7866258::rubric_effects::000::f41c1717b0",
        "PMC7866258::rubric_effects::001::1589586d86"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "High-temperature precipitate dissolution and grain growth reduce hardness or mechanical integrity.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7866258::rubric_effects::001::1589586d86"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sintering in the proposed window will produce greater than 98% theoretical density.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sintering in the proposed window will produce Vickers hardness greater than 600 HV.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::rubric_effects::002::065b5a3f8d"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed material will show a tenfold reduction in oxidation weight gain relative to samples sintered below 800 °C or above 1000 °C.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Below 800 °C, diffusion is insufficient for bulk formation and precipitation of the proposed barrier network.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
